              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "When does Spanish bite the ending off? (When the word is leaning on another word.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "And which English words still carry Latin malus? (Malady, malice.)"
            }
          ]
